// =====================================================================
// /app/briefs/details — Brief detail (editable) · Vibe Code block.
//
// Lives inside the "Brief & Content" tab container as the first tab.
// Per-record block — reads the brief whose recordId is in the page URL
// via useCurrentRecordId + useRecord (no dependency on the page's
// source-filter setting).
//
// Sections (collapsible, in order):
//   1. Overview          — thumbnail, name, status, category, review mode
//   2. Brief             — description JSON parsed into editable cards
//   3. Inspiration       — 3 review picks · 3 swipe picks · 3 URLs
//   4. Details           — production specs (platform, duration, etc.)
//   5. Quality Assurance — Review Agents + 9 thresholds
//   6. Brief context     — target, filmer, channel, awareness, angle
//
// Vibe Code notes:
//   - `updateFields` lists every field this block writes. Adding a
//     field here without a write path breaks the analyser.
//   - LOOKUPs (brand_blueprint, website, accounts, etc.) only ever
//     live in `select`, never in `updateFields`.
//   - All data constants live AFTER Block() so the analyser hits
//     useRecordUpdate before its byte budget.
// =====================================================================

